 "name": "M21-1, Part VIII, Subpart iii, Chapter 7, Section A - General Information on Claims Based on Exposure to  Asbestos",
 "content": "<p style=\"text-align: right\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000177460\" articlename=\"M21-1, Part VIII, Subpart iii, Chapter 6, Section B - Rating Claims Based on Participation in Project Shipboard Hazard and Defense (SHAD)\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000177460?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">&lt;-- Previous Section</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000177462\" articlename=\"M21-1, Part VIII, Subpart iii, Chapter 7, Section B - Development and Examination Requests for Claims  Based on Exposure to Asbestos\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000177462?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">Next Section --&gt;</a></span></span></p><h2><a id=\"top\" name=\"top\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Overview</span></span></strong></a></h2><div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<th scope=\"row\" style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">In This Section</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</th>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\"></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">This section contains the following topics:</span></span></div>\t\t\t<div></div>\t\t\t<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 510px\" summary=\"Column 1 has the topic number and column 2 has the topic title.\">\t\t\t\t<thead>\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\t\t\t\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 90px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<div style=\"text-align: center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><strong>Topic</strong></span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t</th>\t\t\t\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 414px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<div style=\"text-align: center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><strong>Topic Name</strong></span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t</th>\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\t\t\t\t</thead>\t\t\t\t<tbody>\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 90px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">1 </span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 414px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><a href=\"#1\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">SC for Asbestos-Related Diseases</span></span></a></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 90px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">2 </span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 414px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><a href=\"#2\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">General Information on Asbestos and Diseases Related to Asbestos Exposure</span></span></a></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\t\t\t\t</tbody>\t\t\t</table>\t\t\t<div></div>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\"><hr /><br />&nbsp;</div><h2><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">1<a id=\"1\" name=\"1\">.</a>&nbsp; SC for Asbestos-Related Diseases</span></span></strong></h2><p></p><div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px\">\t\t\t<h3><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Change Date</span></span></strong></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\"></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">July 29, 2021</span></span></div>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">VIII.iii.7.A.1.a<a id=\"1a\" name=\"1a\">.</a>&nbsp; Entitlement to Compensation for Conditions Based on Exposure to Asbestos</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\"></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Veterans who were exposed to asbestos while in service and developed a disease related to that asbestos exposure may receive compensation benefits.</span></span></div>\t\t\t<div></div>\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">In order to establish entitlement to compensation based on exposure to asbestos, the evidence must show</span></span></div>\t\t\t<ul>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">in-service asbestos exposure, and</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">a diagnosed disability that has been associated with in-service asbestos exposure.</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t</ul>\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><strong><em>Note</em></strong>:&nbsp; Occupational exposure is the most common cause of asbestosis, but the condition also can have other causes.</span></span></div>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\"><hr /></div><h2></h2><h2><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">2<a id=\"2\" name=\"2\">.</a>&nbsp; General Information on Asbestos and Diseases Related to Asbestos Exposure</span></span></strong></h2><p></p><div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Introduction</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\"></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">This topic contains information on asbestos and diseases related to asbestos exposure, including</span></span></div>\t\t\t<ul>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><a href=\"#2a\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">definition of asbestos</span></span></a></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><a href=\"#2b\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">general effects of asbestos exposure</span></span></a></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><a href=\"#2c\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">prevalence of specific diseases resulting from exposure to asbestos</span></span></a></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><a href=\"#2d\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">latent period for development of disease due to exposure to asbestos</span></span></a>, and</div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><a href=\"#2e\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">diagnostic indicators of asbestosis</span></span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">.</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t</ul>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px\">\t\t\t<h3><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Change Date</span></span></strong></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\"></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">July 29, 2021</span></span></div>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">VIII.iii.7.A.2.a<a id=\"2a\" name=\"2a\">.</a>&nbsp; Definition:&nbsp; Asbestos</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\"></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><strong><em>Asbestos </em></strong>is a fibrous form of silicate mineral of varied chemical composition and physical configuration, derived from serpentine and amphibole ore bodies.</span></span></div>\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Common materials that may contain asbestos include</span></span></div>\t\t\t<ul>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">steam pipes for heating units and boilers</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">ceiling tiles</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">roofing shingles</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">wallboard</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">fire-proofing materials, and</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">thermal insulation.</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t</ul>\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><strong><em>Note</em></strong>:&nbsp; Due to concerns about the safety of asbestos, the use of materials containing asbestos has declined in the U.S. since the 1970s.</span></span></div>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">VIII.iii.7.A.2.b<a id=\"2b\" name=\"2b\">.</a>&nbsp; General Effects of Asbestos Exposure</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\"></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Asbestos fiber masses have a tendency to break easily into tiny dust particles that can float in the air, stick to clothes, and may be inhaled or swallowed.</span></span></div>\t\t\t<div></div>\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Inhalation of asbestos fibers can produce</span></span></div>\t\t\t<ul>\t\t\t\t<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">fibrosis, the most commonly occurring of which is interstitial pulmonary fibrosis, or asbestosis</span></span></li>\t\t\t\t<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">tumors</span></span></li>\t\t\t\t<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">pleural effusions and fibrosis</span></span></li>\t\t\t\t<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">pleural plaques (scars of the lining that surrounds the lungs)</span></span></li>\t\t\t\t<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">mesotheliomas of pleura and peritoneum, and</span></span></li>\t\t\t\t<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">cancers of the</span></span>\t\t\t\t<ul>\t\t\t\t\t<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">lung</span></span></li>\t\t\t\t\t<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">bronchus</span></span></li>\t\t\t\t\t<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">gastrointestinal tract</span></span></li>\t\t\t\t\t<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">larynx</span></span></li>\t\t\t\t\t<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">pharynx, and</span></span></li>\t\t\t\t\t<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">urogenital system, except the prostate.</span></span></li>\t\t\t\t</ul>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t</ul>\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><strong><em>Note</em></strong>:&nbsp; The biological actions of the various fibers differ in some respects, in that</span></span></p>\t\t\t<ul>\t\t\t\t<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">chrysotile products</span></span>\t\t\t\t<ul>\t\t\t\t\t<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">have their initial effects on the small airways of the lung</span></span></li>\t\t\t\t\t<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">cause asbestosis more slowly, and</span></span></li>\t\t\t\t\t<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">result in lung cancer more often, and</span></span></li>\t\t\t\t</ul>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">crocidolite and amosite</span></span>\t\t\t\t<ul>\t\t\t\t\t<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">have more initial effects on the small blood vessels of the lung, alveolar walls, and pleura, and</span></span></li>\t\t\t\t\t<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">result more often in mesothelioma.&nbsp;</span></span></li>\t\t\t\t</ul>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t</ul>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">VIII.iii.7.A.2.c<a id=\"2c\" name=\"2c\">.</a>&nbsp; Prevalence of Specific Diseases Resulting From Exposure to Asbestos</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\"></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Specific diseases that may result from exposure to asbestos include</span></span></div>\t\t\t<ul>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">lung cancer that</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t<ul>\t\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">originates in the lung parenchyma rather than the bronchi, and</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">eventually develops in about 50 percent of persons with asbestosis</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t</ul>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">gastrointestinal cancer that develops in 10 percent of persons with asbestosis</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">urogenital cancer that develops in 10 percent of persons with asbestosis, and</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">mesothelioma that develops in 17 percent of persons with asbestosis.</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t</ul>\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><strong><em>Important</em></strong>:&nbsp;</span></span></div>\t\t\t<ul>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">All persons with significant asbestosis develop cor pulmonale (enlargement of the right ventricle of the heart) and heart disease secondary to disease of the lung or its blood vessels. &nbsp;Those persons who do not die from cancer often die from heart failure secondary to cor pulmonale.</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Disease-causing exposure to asbestos may be</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t<ul>\t\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">brief, and/or</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">indirect.</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t</ul>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t</ul>\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><strong><em>Notes</em></strong>:&nbsp;</span></span></div>\t\t\t<ul>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Current smokers who have been exposed to asbestos face an increased risk of developing bronchial cancer.</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Mesotheliomas are not associated with cigarette smoking.</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t</ul>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">VIII.iii.7.A.2.d<a id=\"2d\" name=\"2d\">.</a>&nbsp; Latent Period for Development of Disease Due to Exposure to Asbestos</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\"></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Many people with asbestos-related diseases have only recently come to medical attention because the latent period for development of disease due to exposure to asbestos ranges from 10 to 45 or more years between first exposure and development of disease.</span></span></div>\t\t\t<div></div>\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><strong><em>Note</em></strong>:&nbsp; The exposure may have been direct or indirect; the extent and duration of exposure is not a factor.</span></span></div>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">VIII.iii.7.A.2.e<a id=\"2e\" name=\"2e\">.</a>&nbsp; Diagnostic Indicators of Asbestosis</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\"></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">A clinical diagnosis of asbestosis requires a history of exposure and radiographic evidence of parenchymal lung disease.&nbsp; Diagnostic indicators include</span></span></div>\t\t\t<ul>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">dyspnea on exertion</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">end-respiratory rales over the lower lobes</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">compensatory emphysema</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">clubbing of the fingers at late stages, and</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">pulmonary function impairment and cor pulmonale that can be demonstrated by instrumental methods.</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t</ul>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\"><hr /></div><p></p><p style=\"text-align: right\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000177460\" articlename=\"M21-1, Part VIII, Subpart iii, Chapter 6, Section B - Rating Claims Based on Participation in Project Shipboard Hazard and Defense (SHAD)\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000177460?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">&lt;-- Previous Section</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000177462\" articlename=\"M21-1, Part VIII, Subpart iii, Chapter 7, Section B - Development and Examination Requests for Claims  Based on Exposure to Asbestos\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000177462?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">Next Section --&gt;</a></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><a href=\"#top\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px\">To Top</span></a></span></p><div></div>",
